  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Closing the Emissions Gap: A Climate Action Roadmap for Limiting Warming to 1.5 Degrees C.  It is unacceptable for people to continue suffering the impacts of climate change around the world. Governments, public and private sectors continuous to hold climate talks and this are not enough. We need to act now through concrete climate actions without giving any excuses. In 2022, the world recorded a number of disasters in the USA, Pakistan, Cameroon and many others, which claimed hundreds of lives.</narrative>
